      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Resource Leak on Error Path**\n\nIf the bulk endpoints cannot be found, the function returns `FT_NO_SUCH_DEV` but fails to release the interface and close the device handle. This will leave the device claimed and permanently leak the `dev_handle`.\n\n**Remediation:** Release the interface and close the device handle before returning:\n```c\nif (!g_ft_boot_ep.ep_bulk_out || !g_ft_boot_ep.ep_bulk_in) {\n    FF_LOGE(...);\n    libusb_release_interface(dev_handle, 0);\n    libusb_close(dev_handle);\n    dev_handle \u003d NULL;\n    return FT_NO_SUCH_DEV;\n}\n```",
